                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "We owe a debt of gratitude to those who have put their lives on the line for our Nation.\n\nOhio @DAVHQ helps veterans file VA claims to access their pension, healthcare, & more.\n\nYesterday I met with them to discuss how Congress can ensure veterans receive the support they deserve!",
