                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill is chock-full of wins for Ohio farmers, ranchers, & producers. It:\n\n- Expands crop insurance & improves risk management tools\n- Boosts market access & reduces trade barriers for American agriculture products\n- Protects family farms from excessive taxes by raising the Death Tax exemption\n- Provides disaster relief\n\nI\u2019m proud to work with Republicans in Congress & President Trump to deliver the results our Ohio agriculture community needs!",
