                "text": "Love seeing the Trump Administration continuing to put patients first. \n\nAmericans deserve transparency when it comes to direct-to-consumer drug advertising so they can make safe & informed decisions about their healthcare.  \n\nCongress should take similar action by passing my bill, HR 3789, so prescription drug costs aren\u2019t a secret. \n\nhttps://t.co/IE7FBtbRRs",
