                "text": "The Working Families Tax Cut will lower taxes for hardworking Ohio families, make a historic investment in rural healthcare and small businesses, secure our borders, & protect critical programs for vulnerable Americans.\n\nI was proud to support it and will continue advocating for the needs of Buckeye families in Congress.",
