                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today and every day, we are grateful to Ohio\u2019s rural healthcare providers for tirelessly working to ensure southern Ohioans receive the care they need.\n\nThanks to President Trump\u2019s leadership, the Rural Health Transformation Program will direct $50 BILLION toward ensuring healthcare is accessible to America\u2019s most rural communities. \n\nI\u2019ll continue working in Congress to ensure our region\u2019s underserved areas have the care they need to thrive.",
